{"schema_version":"question/v1","id":"q-inference-flashattention-001","type":"single_choice","domain":"llm-inference","topic":"attention-kernel","concept_id":"flashattention-io","skill":"mechanism","prompt":"FlashAttention 主要通过什么方式降低 attention 的内存访问开销？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"分块计算并尽量在片上存储中完成中间结果，减少 HBM 往返"},{"id":"b","text":"删除 softmax"},{"id":"c","text":"把 attention 改成卷积"},{"id":"d","text":"只使用 CPU cache"}],"correct_option_ids":["a"],"explanation":"其核心是 IO-aware tiling，同时保持精确 attention 语义，而不是近似删除计算。","wiki_refs":[],"status":"enabled","content_sha256":"sha256:67ebaef70d51079dc5b463eabece826a2c51b6ac04da002add4f6fca4d824d11"}
